25Commissioning and trial operation                                       000390
26   Commissioning and trial operation of all units (e.g.                 000391
26   treatment plant, pressure booster pumps), valves and                 000392
26   other functional units of this bill of quantities.                   000393
26                                                                        000394
26   After completion of the assembly (hydraulic/electrical)              000395
26   an inspection walk takes place.                                      000396
26   The end of assembly is to be notified in writing to                  000397
26   site management.                                                     000398
26   The establishing of the end of assembly relates only to              000399
26   the visual assessment. In doing so the completeness of               000400
26   the scope of supply and of the execution is checked.                 000401
26   After it has been successfully established that the                  000402
26   assembly is completed, the commissioning takes place,                000403
26   which is to be notified in writing to site management.               000404
26                                                                        000405
26   Commissioning and assembly are separated in time from                000406
26   one another. The commissioning can only take place                   000407
26   after completion of the electrical equipment. The                    000408
26   resulting costs for the renewed travel of the required               000409
26   personnel are to be included in the EP incl. all                     000410
26   ancillary costs, subsistence allowances, travel costs                000411
26   etc.                                                                 000412
26                                                                        000413
26   In doing so the following tests are carried out:                     000414
26   Pressure test of the overall plant. DIN EN 805 / DIN                 000415
26   4279, test pressure according to requirement PN 10 for               000416
26   all plant parts in the inlet of the clean water tanks /              000417
26   test pressure PN 16 for all plant parts from the clean               000418
26   water pumping station. The proof is to be documented in              000419
26   writing.                                                             000420
26   Checking of the equipment set-up, optimisation of the                000421
26   place of installation                                                000422
26   Test run until the intended operation of all plant                   000423
26   parts is proven.                                                     000424
26                                                                        000425
26   The commissioning takes place at the same time as the                000426
26   AN electrical engineering and is divided into:                       000427
26   Individual commissioning for all units / measurements                000428
26   incl. setting and adjustment of all required mechanical              000429
26   and electrical parameters.                                           000430
26   Commissioning of the entire plant in connection with                 000431
26   the interaction of all units / measurements / signal                 000432
26   transmitters etc., incl. setting and adjustment of all               000433
26   required mechanical and electrical parameters.                       000434
26   During the commissioning the PLC program is to be                    000435
26   optimised.                                                           000436
26                                                                        000437
26   For this, independent coordination of dates with the AN              000438
26   electrical engineering.                                              000439
26   After commissioning has taken place a trial operation                000440
26   is carried out.                                                      000441
26   With the trial operation an intensive support of the                 000442
26   operator's personnel (at least 1d/week) is to be                     000443
26   provided for the duration of 4 weeks.                                000444
26   To be included in the price are all required measuring               000445
26   instruments, personnel, aids and travel costs.                       000446
26                                                                        000447
26   It is pointed out that interruptions of the trial                    000448
26   operation for which the AN is responsible result in a                000449
26   corresponding extension of this trial operation. In the              000450
26   case of larger interruptions the trial operation is                  000451
26   broken off and is to be restarted from the beginning                 000452
26   after the problems have been remedied.                               000453
26   Basic settings changed in the running-in / optimisation              000454
26   operation are to be documented in a commissioning                    000455
26   report.                                                              000456
26                                                                        000457
26   The aim during this period is to optimise the                        000458
26   expenditure of personnel and energy. Furthermore the                 000459
26   automation is to be coordinated with the telecontrol                 000460
26   system (fault messages etc.).                                        000461
