25Analytical proof of guaranteed values                                   000465
26   The functional capability of the treatment plant is to               000466
26   be proven by sampling. For this the following analyses               000467
26   of an independent and certified laboratory are to be                 000468
26   submitted:                                                           000469
26                                                                        000470
26   In total 3 times at intervals of two weeks until the                 000471
26   end of the trial operation a small chemical-technical                000472
26   analysis with microbiology raw water and clean water                 000473
26   (after treatment)                                                    000474
26                                                                        000475
26   The following values are to be determined at least in                000476
26   each case:                                                           000477
26   Temperature and pH on site                                           000478
26   Calcite dissolution capacity                                         000479
26   Arsenic                                                              000480
26   Turbidity                                                            000481
26   CO2                                                                  000482
26   Oxygen                                                               000483
26   Odour                                                                000484
26   Freedom from germs ([PERSON_00000000000000000160]                    000485
26   bacteria, Escherichia coli, enterococci, culturable                  000486
26   microorganisms as colony count at 22 øC and 36 øC).                  000487
