25Maintenance contract                                                    000509
26   Maintenance contract for all maintenance-relevant plant              000510
26   parts of this bill of quantities for the duration of                 000511
26   the warranty period.                                                 000512
26                                                                        000513
26   With conclusion of the maintenance contract the period               000514
26   of the warranty is extended to 4 years.                              000515
26                                                                        000516
26   The maintenance contract contains the following                      000517
26   services to be carried out annually:                                 000518
26   1. Inspecting the plant.                                             000519
26   2. Maintaining the plant.                                            000520
26   3. Supplying and replacing the wearing parts of the                  000521
26   plant required for faultless function and operational                000522
26   safety, whose service life under usual operating                     000523
26   conditions falls short of the warranty period; incl.                 000524
26   proper disposal of the old parts and materials.                      000525
26   4. Supplying or providing all aids needed (e.g.                      000526
26   measuring instruments, tools) and auxiliary materials                000527
26   (e.g. lubricants and cleaning agents), including                     000528
26   ladders and vehicles.                                                000529
26                                                                        000530
26   In good time before acceptance a detailed maintenance                000531
26   contract in PERSON_097 is to be submitted to the AG.                 000532
26                                                                        000533
26   The EP offered covers the period between acceptance and              000534
26   end of the warranty period, i.e. four years.                         000535
26   Billing outside the final invoice, in each case after                000536
26   expiry of one year.                                                  000537
26                                                                        000538
26   The maintenance contract is commissioned separately                  000539
