26   [PERSON_00000070] ### BBE-2.1                                        001644
26   Material PER000115 drawing no. 58.00.00.00-R3,                       001645
26   for free-flowing bulk materials, in particular also for              001646
26   use in low rooms,                                                    001647
26   consisting of a robust steel frame, incl. lifting                    001648
26   device. The lifting device is mounted on rollers and                 001649
26   equipped with an adjustable chains cone that shapes the              001650
26   Big Bag conically.                                                   001651
26   Triggering of the lifting device by gas springs on                   001652
26   weight decrease in the Big Bag. Suitable for almost all              001653
26   Big Bag sizes.                                                       001654
26   For Big Bags dimension: up to approx. 120 cm x 100 cm                001655
26   (B x L),                                                             001656
26   Total height: approx. 1190 mm                                        001657
26   Gas spring stroke: approx. 350 mm                                    001658
26   Frame material: PER000115 1.4301                                     001659
26   Surface: glass bead blasted                                          001660
26                                                                        001661
26   Including maintenance-free rope-iris dosing valve, ###               001662
26   BIDV-7.1-S-S, long version, with manual operation and                001663
26   re-locking.                                                          001664
26   (The re-locking automatically turns the valve further                001665
26   closed by means of integrated gas springs when material              001666
26   settles in the Big Bag outlet).                                      001667
26   The valve rotary unit consists of a roller-guided                    001668
26   slewing ring with glass-fibre-stabilised stainless                   001669
26   steel rope arcs, plastic-reinforced, which are arranged              001670
26   in iris shape. The hand lever turns by 180ø and is                   001671
26   recessed in the frame section in the end positions.                  001672
26   Valve base housing: material 1.4301                                  001673
26   Valve mechanism: material 1.4301 except bearings                     001674
26   Valve rotary unit: material 1.4301                                   001675
26   The mechanism of the valve is maintenance-free.                      001676
26   Functions directly at the Big Bag outlet: closing                    001677
26   product grain size smaller than 5 æm, dosing, re-tying               001678
26   (partially emptied Big Bags can thereby be taken out                 001679
26   again).                                                              001680
26                                                                        001681
26   Including 1 piece sub-platform for Big Bag PERSON_70,                001682
26   executed as robust stainless steel frame, foot design                001683
26   steel plates with fastening holes. The Big Bag                       001684
26   PERSON_70 is U-shaped open towards the front.                        001685
26   Material: PER000115 1.4301                                           001686
26   Surface: glass bead blasted                                          001687
26   Installation height: approx. 1200 mm - to be adapted to              001688
26   local conditions: before ordering, coordination with                 001689
